        <div style="display:none">
        <ix:header><ix:hidden><ix:footnote id="FN20240322153816295" xml:lang="en-US">	 For 2023 and 2022, potentially dilutive securities (share options) were excluded from the calculation of diluted earnings per share as they are antidilutive</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20240322095113134" xml:lang="en-US">Reclassified in respect of discontinued operations - see Note 25.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20240322155524361" xml:lang="en-US">Includes payments to shareholders for the years ended 2023, 2022 and 2021 of $475, $503 and $455, respectively.</ix:footnote>
