<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25"><span style="font-weight: bold">ITEM 3.</span>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style="font-weight: bold">KEY
INFORMATION</span></div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25"><span style="font-weight: bold">A.</span>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style="font-weight: bold">Reserved.</span></div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25"><span style="font-weight: bold">B.</span>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style="font-weight: bold">Capitalization
and Indebtedness</span></div>

