<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25"><span style="font-weight: bold">C.</span>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style="font-weight: bold">Reasons
for the Offer and Use of Proceeds</span></div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

