        <div style="line-height: 1.25; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, serif"><span style="font-weight: bold">BLKMKT&#8482;</span>, the Company&#8217;s
        second Canadian brand, super premium product line with indoor grown, hand-dried and hand-trimmed high-THC cannabis flowers. The BLKMKT&#8482;
        includes JEALOUSY, BACIO GLTO, PNPL P, PARK FIRE OG, UPSIDE DOWN C. In Q4 2023, the Company relaunched JEALOUSY and BACIO GLTO.</div>
        </div> </div> </td>
    <td style="width: 20%">
