<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: bold">Board Diversity</div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25">The Company believes it is important that its Board is composed of individuals reflecting
the diversity represented by our employees, our customers, and our communities. Below is enhanced disclosure regarding the diversity of
the Board as required by the Nasdaq&#8217;s Board Diversity Rule:</div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

