<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: -20pt; margin-left: 20pt; line-height: 1.25">Notes:</div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="z55584d29c8a9412aaf72cace83435af1" class="DSPFListTable" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, serif; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000">
