<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25"><span style="font-weight: bold">F.</span>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style="font-weight: bold">Expenses
of the Issue</span></div>

