                            <p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><strong>SIGNIFICANT ACCOUNTING POLICIES (Cont.)</strong></p>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
