                <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:85.05pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">As of December 31, 2023 and 2022, major subsidiaries over which the Company has control, directly or indirectly, include:</span></span></div>
                <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
