              <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif;clear:both">&#160;</div>
              <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:56.7pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">During the years ended December 31, 2023, 2022 and 2021, inventory expensed to cost of revenue of cannabis products was $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20220305060115471" name="ifrs-full:CostOfMerchandiseSold" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">35,154</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20220305060123021" name="ifrs-full:CostOfMerchandiseSold" contextRef="C_20220101to20221231" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">63,517</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240322151601356" name="ifrs-full:CostOfMerchandiseSold" contextRef="C_20210101to20211231" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">43,720</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, which included $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20220305060132060" name="imc:NonCashExpenseRelatedToChangesInFairValueOfInventorySold" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">984</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20220305060137861" name="imc:NonCashExpenseRelatedToChangesInFairValueOfInventorySold" contextRef="C_20220101to20221231" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4,342 </ix:nonFraction>and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240322151626306" name="imc:NonCashExpenseRelatedToChangesInFairValueOfInventorySold" contextRef="C_20210101to20211231" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">8,796</ix:nonFraction> of non-cash expense (out of which, a total of $<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fxbrl_20240322151612139">nil</span>, $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230327141301927" name="imc:RealizedFairValueAdjustmentOnInventorySold" contextRef="C_20220101to20221231_ifrsfullContinuingAndDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_ifrsfullDiscontinuedOperationsMember" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" sign="-">2,528 </ix:nonFraction>and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230327141309081" name="imc:RealizedFairValueAdjustmentOnInventorySold" contextRef="C_20210101to20211231_ifrsfullContinuingAndDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_ifrsfullDiscontinuedOperationsMember" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" sign="-">226 </ix:nonFraction>attributable to the discontinued operations of the Canadian entities, see Note 25), respectively, related to the changes in fair value of inventory sold.</span></span></div>
              <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
              <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:56.7pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Cost of revenues in 2023, 2022 and 2021, also include production overhead not allocated to costs of inventory produced and recognized as an expense as incurred.</span></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </ix:nonNumeric>
      <p style="margin:0pt">&#160;</p>
