              <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:56.7pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Leases of buildings have lease terms of between <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20240322164408024" name="ifrs-full:UsefulLifeMeasuredAsPeriodOfTimePropertyPlantAndEquipment" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis_ifrsfullBuildingsMember_ifrsfullRangeAxis_ifrsfullBottomOfRangeMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear">5</ix:nonNumeric> and <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20240322164444728" name="ifrs-full:UsefulLifeMeasuredAsPeriodOfTimePropertyPlantAndEquipment" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis_ifrsfullBuildingsMember_ifrsfullRangeAxis_ifrsfullTopOfRangeMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear">12</ix:nonNumeric> years, whereas leases of motor vehicles usually have lease terms of <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20240322162628606" name="ifrs-full:UsefulLifeMeasuredAsPeriodOfTimePropertyPlantAndEquipment" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis_ifrsfullMotorVehiclesMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear">3</ix:nonNumeric> years.</span></span></div>
