          <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
          <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:85.05pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Awards granted under the company&#8217;s current plan which was approved by the board of directors on December 19, 2018 (&#8220;2018 Plan&#8221;) are subject to vesting schedules and unless determined otherwise by the administrator of the 2018 Plan, generally vest following a period of three years from the applicable vesting commencement date, such that <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20210428045024529" name="imc:PercentageOfAwardsVest" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember_imcVestingAxis_imcFirstAnniversaryOfApplicableVestingCommencementDateMember" unitRef="Percentage" scale="-2" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">33.3</ix:nonFraction>% of the awards vest on the first anniversary of the applicable vesting commencement date and <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20210428045112168" name="imc:PercentageOfAwardsVest" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember_imcVestingAxis_imcVestInEightEqualInstallmentsUponLapseOfEachThreeMonthPeriodThereafterMember" unitRef="Percentage" scale="-2" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">66.7</ix:nonFraction>% of the awards vest in eight equal installments upon the lapse of each three-month period thereafter. Subject to the discretion of the 2018 Plan administrator, if an award has not been exercised within seven years after the date of the grant, the award expires. As of December 31, 2023, <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20210428045403965" name="imc:NumberOfSharesAvailableForFutureGrants" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="Share" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">746,352</ix:nonFraction> Ordinary shares are available for future grants under the 2018 Plan.</span></span></div>
          <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
          <div style="margin-left:90pt">
            <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20240323124504253" name="imc:DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutOptionsValuationAssumptionsExplanatory" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231" escape="true">
