          <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:85.05pt;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span>*) Includes $nil Options exercised under cashless mechanism to $nil Common shares.</span></span></span></div>
          <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
          <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:85.05pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The weighted average remaining contractual life for the share options outstanding as of December 31, 2023 and 2022 was <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20210428050338427" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageRemainingContractualLifeOfOutstandingShareOptions2019" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear">3.76</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years and <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20210428050423397" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageRemainingContractualLifeOfOutstandingShareOptions2019" contextRef="C_20220101to20221231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear">4.32</ix:nonNumeric> years, respectively.</span></span></div>
          <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
          <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:85.05pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The share-based payment expenses for the years ended December 31, 2023, 2022 and 2021, amounted to $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20210428050534423" name="ifrs-full:ExpenseFromSharebasedPaymentTransactionsWithEmployees" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">225</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20210428050553662" name="ifrs-full:ExpenseFromSharebasedPaymentTransactionsWithEmployees" contextRef="C_20220101to20221231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,637</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240323104650195" name="ifrs-full:ExpenseFromSharebasedPaymentTransactionsWithEmployees" contextRef="C_20210101to20211231_ifrsfullTypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_imcShareIncentivePlanMember" unitRef="CAD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,422</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</span></span></div>
          <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
          <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:85.05pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The following table lists the number of restricted share units (&#8220;RSUs&#8221;) as of December 31, 2023:</span></span></div>
          <div style="line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif">&#160;</div>
          <div style="margin-left:90pt">
            <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20240323124634812" name="imc:DisclosureOfRestrictedShareUnitsTableTextBlock" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231" escape="true">
